<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13623] Scaladoc not created during release process</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13623</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Scaladoc creation is broken (probably by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11933&quot; title=&quot;Build scalar scaladoc only if javadoc profile is active&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-11933&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-11933&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;). We have 3 release assemblies without scaladoc now (2.8, 2.8.1, 2.9).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13337145">IGNITE-13623</key>
            <summary>Scaladoc not created during release process</summary>
